From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sample_dsp: use sample firmware by default

The production adsp image hosts the GUA/SMF audio services and does not
implement the command protocol exercised by sample_dsp.  The companion
adsp-sample image contains horizon-algo-sample and hifi-fft-cplx handlers.

Select adsp-sample by default so the documented path-only invocation does not
time out while trying to speak the sample protocol to the production image.
Users can still override the firmware name with -n.
---
 sample_dsp/sample_dsp.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sample_dsp/sample_dsp.cpp b/sample_dsp/sample_dsp.cpp
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/sample_dsp/sample_dsp.cpp
+++ b/sample_dsp/sample_dsp.cpp
@@ -56,7 +56,7 @@ pthread_t thread_id[IPC_CHAN_NUM];
 
 static const char *dsp_path = "/usr/hobot/lib/firmware/";
 static int32_t algo_type = 1;
-static const char *dsp_name = "adsp";
+static const char *dsp_name = "adsp-sample";
 
 volatile sig_atomic_t g_running = true;
 
-- 
2.39.5
